Scope and exceptions — read before reusing anything from this repository:

1. Source code. This license is written for content and data, not
   software (Creative Commons explicitly recommends against using CC
   licenses for code, since they do not address patent rights or software
   distribution the way licenses such as MIT or Apache-2.0 do). The
   maintainer has chosen, deliberately, to apply CC BY 4.0 to this
   repository's TypeScript/React source as well as its documentation and
   generated data — reusers of the *code* specifically should be aware of
   that mismatch before relying on it in a software context.

2. METADAX brand and design system. The METADAX name, logo, and visual
   identity are property of METADAX CONSULTORIA LTDA (CNPJ
   65.640.808/0001-89) and are NOT covered by this CC BY 4.0 license. Their
   use here follows METADAX's own brand manual
   (https://www.metadax.com.br/manual-de-marca), not an open license — see
   docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md.

3. Upstream data attribution. Election and candidate data originates from
   the Tribunal Superior Eleitoral (TSE) — dadosabertos.tse.jus.br and the
   DivulgaCandContas system. Company/CNPJ data is sourced via BrasilAPI
   (MIT-licensed, https://github.com/BrasilAPI/BrasilAPI), itself built on
   public Receita Federal registry data. Public-spending cross-reference
   data comes from the Portal da Transparência (Controladoria-Geral da
   União — CGU). See docs/DATA_SOURCES.md §8 for the full compatibility
   analysis. When redistributing data derived from this project, credit
   the original source (TSE / CGU / Receita Federal via BrasilAPI) in
   addition to this repository.
